---
import LegalPage from '~/components/LegalPage.astro';
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '~/i18n/utils';

const t = useTranslations('en');
---

<Base locale="en" path="/cookies" title={`${t('legal.cookiesTitle')} | CLAR EXPERT`}>
  <LegalPage locale="en" path="/cookies" titleKey="cookiesTitle">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 19, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. What are cookies</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files that websites store on your device (computer, phone, tablet) when you visit them. They allow the website to function properly and to remember certain information about your visit.</p>

    <h2>2. Who we are</h2>
    <p>CL Accounting Reporting SRL (trading as "CLAR EXPERT"), registered office at Str. Paris nr. 36, Sector 1, Bucharest, Romania, Tax ID RO 35695768.</p>
    <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:office@clar-expert.com">office@clar-expert.com</a> | <a href="tel:+40728008141">+40 728 008 141</a></p>

    <h2>3. Our own cookies</h2>
    <p>Our website <strong>does not place any of its own cookies</strong> and <strong>does not use any analytics or tracking tools</strong>. We do not collect data about your browsing behavior.</p>

    <h2>4. Third-party technical cookies</h2>
    <p>The website is hosted through <strong>Cloudflare Inc.</strong>, which may automatically place technical cookies (e.g. <code>__cf_bm</code>) for bot protection and security purposes. These cookies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Are <strong>strictly necessary</strong> for infrastructure operation;</li>
      <li>Do not store personal data;</li>
      <li>Expire within 30 minutes at most.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We have no control over these cookies. For details, see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>5. How to manage cookies</h2>
    <p>You can configure your browser to block or delete cookies. Instructions for:
      <a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome</a>,
      <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/cookies-information-websites-store-on-your-computer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Firefox</a>,
      <a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Safari</a>,
      <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Edge</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Changes</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to update this policy. Any changes will be published on this page with the updated date.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about cookies, write to us at <a href="mailto:office@clar-expert.com">office@clar-expert.com</a>.</p>
  </LegalPage>
</Base>
